                    coach_overbudget:       `<strong>You blew through the CA$6.0M envelope.</strong> A scramble for a crude saving to stay in budget re-opened the very risk you were closing. Temperance applies to spending too — a sound fix doesn't need to overrun.`,

                    coach_r1_frame_character: `<strong>That's the right frame.</strong> Legality is a floor, not the standard — your entire brand is 'beyond the minimum.' Treating this as a character problem, with Judgment integrating the dimensions, is what lets you reach a decision you can actually defend, teach and repeat.`,
                    coach_r1_frame_financial: `<strong>A pure CA$22M-vs-CA$4.2M calculation misses the point.</strong> The cheaper number isn't the right number for a child-safety brand. This is a character problem first; the money is one input to Judgment, not the whole decision.`,
                    coach_r1_frame_legal:     `<strong>Legality is a floor, not your standard.</strong> The seat passed the regulatory test and still fell below the safety bar you promise. 'We're compliant, so we ship' is exactly the reasoning a cold-February field incident makes indefensible.`,
                    coach_r1_frame_political: `<strong>Managing your week-three image is not leadership.</strong> Make the perception the goal and you'll under-weight Courage and Accountability precisely when they matter most. Frame the decision, not your reputation.`,
